			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 752330301,
					"content": "呼——還好還好，只是普通的舞蹈而已，沒有出什麼問題。這下想必是能安全過關了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330302,
					"content": "哼，不要以為完成了規定中的舞蹈就可以了！舞臺的高潮現在才剛剛開始呢！來吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330303,
					"content": "要、要來了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330304,
					"content": "「承載綻放刺梨的奇蹟，用聖火點燃你的笑容！以悠悠度假村之名，為你獻上歡迎的舞蹈，閃耀吧！皮皮潘偶像！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330305,
					"content": "糟了！這、這個動作——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330306,
					"content": "啊——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330307,
					"content": "果然，又在這個動作失敗了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330308,
					"content": "大、大師，請再給我一次機會…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330309,
					"content": "想要機會？聲音再洪亮一點！妳之前哭的氣勢去哪了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330310,
					"content": "大、大師，請再給我一次機會！我想當皮皮潘偶像！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330311,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330312,
					"content": "…好！很有氣勢！妳合格了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330313,
					"content": "這樣也算合格嗎？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330314,
					"content": "當然合格！毅力比舞技重要多了！有了毅力，你就可以在一切強敵面前無所畏懼，在一切戰場上都傲然屹立！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330315,
					"content": "毅力，就是偶像的精神肌肉！妳已經具備了基本的偶像之力。妳，過關！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330316,
					"content": "雖、雖然我有很多想說的話…但結果好，就是好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
