					"content": "哦？現在為難粉絲的人出場了，身為偶像又該如何應對這場危機呢？讓我們拭目以待吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧胡帝亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330503,
					"content": "欸、欸？這也是偶像的工作的一部分嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330504,
					"content": "如此，才能被稱為納塔偶像啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧胡帝亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330505,
					"content": "不要什麼事情都用這句話接啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330506,
					"content": "#少、少囉嗦！{F#妳}{M#你}們要不然破財，要不然破相，選一個吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330507,
						752330508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "看起來很魁梧的人"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330507,
					"content": "我選三，把你們揍一頓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 752330508,
					"content": "我選擇讓你們破相。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
