					"content": "總、總而言之，我們現在終於拿到決賽的資格了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330902,
					"content": "決、決賽，我真的可以嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330903,
					"content": "一、一定沒問題的！妳看，之前的要求我們不是輕輕鬆鬆就達成了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330904,
					"content": "#而且經歷了這麼多，妳一定比以前更優秀了，一定能成為合格的皮皮潘偶像的。{F#妳}{M#你}說對不對，{NICKNAME}？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330905,
						752330906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330905,
					"content": "相信自己。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330908
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752330908,
					"content": "嗯！那、那我們現在就出發吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330906,
					"content": "應該吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330907
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752330907,
					"content": "#哎呀，{F#妳}{M#你}也對她有信心一點啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
