			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 752331101,
					"content": "雖然「希頓」在舞臺上表現出色，但遺憾的是，由於與其他選手實力相差懸殊，她最終與冠軍失之交臂…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752331102,
					"content": "嗚——又、又失敗了，我連前三名都不是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331103,
					"content": "別、別灰心啦！最起碼我們已經闖入了決賽啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331104,
					"content": "我早就說過了，偶像之路可是很殘酷的，它上面閃耀的不是光芒，是汗水！妳的基本功明顯還不夠！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331105,
					"content": "這、這個聲音是…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331106,
					"content": "我、我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331107,
					"content": "不過，能走出第一步就是巨大的進步了。更何況妳還撐了兩個回合，比我預想中的多多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331108,
					"content": "老爹…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331109,
					"content": "等一下，原來他就是妳的老爹嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331110,
					"content": "哼，只不過有一點點進步而已，不代表妳可以驕傲自滿了！妳的基本功太差了，不然也不會輸得這麼難看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331111,
					"content": "現在就跟我回家，我要從零開始鍛煉妳！還有，現在我是妳的老師，妳該叫我「大師」才對！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331112,
					"content": "大師！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331113,
					"content": "嗯，做好心理準備，戰爭可不會給妳跪地求饒的機會！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331114,
					"content": "好的，大師！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希頓」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331115,
					"content": "所以，在你們的眼中，偶像到底是什麼東西啊喂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
